### Create employee 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nguyen van an",
  "email": "an@example.com",
  "departmentName": "IT"
}

### Create employee 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "tran thi binh",
  "email": "binh@example.com",
  "departmentName": "HR"
}

### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees

### Search employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?keyword=IT

### Get employee by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1

### Update employee 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nguyen van an updated",
  "email": "an.updated@example.com",
  "departmentName": "Engineering"
}

### Validation error: blank name and invalid email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json  

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "departmentName": "IT"
}

### Validation error: missing department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "le van cuong",
  "email": "cuong@example.com"
}

### Bad request: duplicated email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "another employee",
  "email": "an@example.com",
  "departmentName": "IT"
}

### Not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/999

### Delete employee 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1

### Not found after delete
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1
